{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive in a post apocalyptic wasteland, scavenge leftover goods to stay alive, find vehicles to move around faster, and find weapons and ammo to defend yourself with. Explore with a friend or fight them for what loot they have.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an early access version of my game Ruins, This is my very first game, I am a solo dev who has been working on this project for 8+ years now and is not finished yet, but would like to get player feedback for what I have so far and will continue to post updates frequently as I get more done. Many of the meshes are placeholders and will be updated as I go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Current major features and additions include:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Splitscreen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climbing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swimming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drowning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicles (Boats, Helicopters, and Cars).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ragdolls (When moving too fast, falling, jumping from moving vehicles, etc.).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon Durability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Audio Fades Underwater.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animals (Currently Only Deer and Fish).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4039150?t=1759713604","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4039150?t=1759713604","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039150/8659e1a683dbc74baa80209a217206573a8e208f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759713604","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039150/8659e1a683dbc74baa80209a217206573a8e208f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759713604","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","